E"><h3>Mana Engine</h3><p class="requirement">Wizard · Level 20 · choose one</p><p>Permitted INT-scaled Magic regeneration is multiplied by 1.50; suppression and the fixed 100 cap remain absolute.</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 122</div></article><article class="page" id="fallbacks" data-title="Fallback feats"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Fallback feats</h2><section class="entry" id="FALLBACK_CHA"><h3>Make an Impression</h3><p class="requirement">permanent CHA &lt; 30</p><p>Adds +1 permanent permanent cha. Repeatable across later feat opportunities until intrinsic permanent CHA reaches 30.</p></section><section class="entry" id="FALLBACK_CON"><h3>Tough It Out</h3><p class="requirement">permanent CON &lt; 30</p><p>Adds +1 permanent permanent con. Repeatable across later feat opportunities until intrinsic permanent CON reaches 30.</p></section><section class="entry" id="FALLBACK_DEX"><h3>Light Feet</h3><p class="requirement">permanent DEX &lt; 30</p><p>Adds +1 permanent permanent dex. Repeatable across later feat opportunities until intrinsic permanent DEX reaches 30.</p></section><section class="entry" id="FALLBACK_INT"><h3>Quick Study</h3><p class="requirement">permanent INT &lt; 30</p><p>Adds +1 permanent permanent int. Repeatable across later feat opportunities until intrinsic permanent INT reaches 30.</p></section><section class="entry" id="FALLBACK_STR"><h3>Put Your Back Into It</h3><p class="requirement">permanent STR &lt; 30</p><p>Adds +1 permanent permanent str. Repeatable across later feat opportunities until intrinsic permanent STR reaches 30.</p></section><section class="entry" id="FALLBACK_WIS"><h3>Keep Your Wits</h3><p class="requirement">permanent WIS &lt; 30</p><p>Adds +1 permanent permanent wis. Repeatable across later feat opportunities until intrinsic permanent WIS reaches 30.</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 123</div></article><article class="page" id="properties" data-title="Equipment 